[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4787908558","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120212#issuecomment-4787908558","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120212","id":4787908558,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABHWGvzg","user":{"login":"HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction","html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-24T09:42:40Z","updated_at":"2026-06-24T09:42:40Z","body":"Looking at this I'm kinda wondering whether it would make sense at this point to put `extends` into its own AST node. With this PR we would have:\r\n\r\n`extends_used`, `extends_path`, `extends`, `extends_start_line`, `extends_start_column`, `extends_end_line`, `extends_end_column`\r\n\r\nwhich feels like `ClassNode` is getting increasingly bloated.\r\n\r\nCC @dalexeev do you see any issues with altering the AST for this?\r\n\r\n","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4787908558/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4788151817","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120212#issuecomment-4788151817","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120212","id":4788151817,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABHWVmCQ","user":{"login":"dalexeev","id":47700418,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NzAwNDE4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47700418?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev","html_url":"https://github.com/dalexeev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-24T10:11:36Z","updated_at":"2026-06-24T10:12:19Z","body":"> Looking at this I'm kinda wondering whether it would make sense at this point to put `extends` into its own AST node.\r\n\r\nI think this makes sense, but it's **not** required for this PR. It's probably best left for a follow-up PR.\r\n\r\nNote that four of these fields (`extends_start_line`, `extends_start_column`, `extends_end_line`, `extends_end_column)` exist only because we don't have an abstraction for source regions. The other three (`extends_used`, `extends_path`, `extends`) could be replaced with `TypeNode` if it supported the choice between a path (a string literal) and an identifier. So we could get by with a single field `TypeNode *extends_type = nullptr;`. However, even in this case, the field would only point to the type chain, without the `extends` keyword included into the source region. So introducing `ExtendsNode` seems justified to me. Especially considering that unifying source regions and `TypeNode` would likely be a more major change than introducing `ExtendsNode`.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4788151817/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4788410771","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120212#issuecomment-4788410771","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120212","id":4788410771,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABHWlZkw","user":{"login":"HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction","html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/received_events","type":"User","user_view